/www.coolapk.com/t/%E9%A3%9E%E7%89%9B%E7%A7%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%91fnOS?type=0&quot;&gt;#飞牛私有云fnOS#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/Magisk%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97?type=0&quot;&gt;#Magisk模块#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E9%82%A3%E4%BA%9B%E5%A5%BD%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84magisk%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97?type=0&quot;&gt;#那些好用的magisk模块#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/18e543fed851763f630f06021f5f5bc0.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/757306c315dbc42e1a141ca47c9ecd23.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73063877</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73063877</guid><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 07:06:02 GMT</pubDate><author>Seraph907</author></item><item><title>#Emby# 就这样填，白嫖的服务器，不确定能用多久。</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/Emby?type=0&quot;&gt;#Emby#&lt;/a&gt;  就这样填，白嫖的服务器，不确定能用多久。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/29b84ed94b1919c13b48b867b6f76e90.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73058767</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73058767</guid><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 22:58:15 GMT</pubDate><author>青帝sky</author></item><item><title>当贝B1S电视盒子刷了飞牛，一不小心电源接口被扯坏，换了个电源接口，不会焊，调高温度大力狂怼，不知道焊成了什么鬼东西，但是竟然还能正常开机，此刻一位垃圾...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;当贝B1S电视盒子刷了飞牛，一不小心电源接口被扯坏，换了个电源接口，不会焊，调高温度大力狂怼，不知道焊成了什么鬼东西，但是竟然还能正常开机，此刻一位垃圾佬的快乐达到了顶峰
&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E5%88%B7%E6%9C%BA?type=0&quot;&gt;#刷机#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E7%9B%92%E5%AD%90?type=0&quot;&gt;#电视盒子#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/3cd61a70cdb6d94c3fd0957ac1ac8e3c.jpeg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/678692d4dd7a70c365eebfd088f7d6a0.jpeg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73058150</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/73058150</guid><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 18:47:28 GMT</pubDate><author>我没有的我有</author></item></channel></rss>